  1737	    A line-positioned loss sitting BEFORE the boundary reset's line carries no
  1738	    weight: the ceremony decreed trust in a head, and everything positionally
  1739	    behind that decree is what it decreed past. Without this the operator runs
  1740	    the ceremony, gets a correct K, and is still handed a bounded read forever
  1741	    from damage the reset was run to put behind them.
