   644	        # function is only reached by lines it judged entry-shaped. A kindless
   645	        # object arriving here is one this build cannot name, and the caller
   646	        # reports it as a skipped line rather than absorbing it silently,
   647	        # which is the whole of BLOCKING-1.
   648	        return None
