   927	def entry_identity(entry: HeadAttestation) -> str:
   928	    """What a trust reset names when it binds itself to its predecessor.
   929	
   930	    A digest over the entry's own serialized line, which is deterministic —
   931	    :func:`_entry_line` sorts keys and omits empty optionals — so an appender
   932	    and a reader compute the same value from the same entry without the raw
   933	    bytes having to be carried around.
