   936	    residual is stated: an entry written by a later build carries fields this
   937	    one drops, so its digest here differs from the digest its own build would
   938	    compute. A reset bound to such an entry is therefore not honored, *K*
   939	    stays at the higher head, and the note says so — the refusal-side failure
