  1104	    ones this build skipped — never an index among the entries that happened to
  1105	    parse. That distinction is the whole of the position claim: an index among
  1106	    valid entries is a judgment, and a future build that classifies one line
  1107	    differently renumbers every entry after it, silently voiding every reset
