  1112	    WITHOUT the judgment built on top of them. That judgment can refuse —
  1113	    :func:`_known_of` raises on equivocation — and the trust-reset ceremony
  1114	    needs the last entry precisely when the journal is in a state a full read
  1115	    will not answer for. A recovery path that depended on the read it recovers
  1116	    from would be unusable exactly when it is needed.
  1117	    """
