   554	    makes a replayed copy inexpressible as valid — see
   555	    :attr:`~engine.arrival_head_attestation.HeadAttestation.follows`. Binding
   556	    it here is the FOOTGUN GUARD, not the protection: an operator constructing
   557	    an entry by hand still produces one, and the protection is the read-time
   558	    validation in ``_epoch_of``, which is what every reader performs. A writer
   559	    that raced another appender between this read and its own write produces a
