   837	        <div class="doc-section-header">
   838	          <span class="doc-section-number">09</span>
   839	          <h2>Layered audit posture</h2>
   840	        </div>
   841	        <p>
   842	          No single “hash database” command should stand in for all integrity claims. Operations
   843	          combine four layers with different costs and answers.
   844	        </p>
