- cause × physical-position weighting;
- structural absences retaining weight;
- epoch-scoped `at_least`;
- positioned damage healing through weighting;
- failed ceremonies healing through backward epoch-walk short-circuiting;
- voided-reset notes necessarily originating above the accepted boundary;
- degraded reads writing neither journal entries nor bindings.

The arbiter-applied `_degraded` paragraph now correctly says damage is recorded forever but weighed only until an operator decree supersedes it ([arrival_head_seam.py:1204](/Users/kaygee/Code/loops-s3wp1/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_head_seam.py:1204)); the remainder of the docstring remains consistent.

